# dev-notes.30 — worker-layout-option-c-finalize-v1

Date: 2026-06-08
Branch/slice: worker-layout-option-c-finalize-v1

## Purpose

Close out the Worker Layout Option C branch family with final branch-family documentation, candidate/staged artifact packaging, artifact/package verification, final handoff notes, and a minimal real-runtime smoke-test setup preflight discovered during final verification.

This is a finalization branch. It does not perform another worker extraction and does not change production runtime behavior. The only code changes are test-harness diagnostics for real-runtime dependency resolution and real-runtime active-prompt target reliability.

## Source-truth posture

Active source truth remains the GitHub `modularization` branch until Michael confirms the branch family has been merged or superseded.

The local formatted mirror used for staging was:

```text
