```

Treat local ZIPs, sandbox files, generated packages, and checkpoint files as reviewable artifacts or freeze points. Do not let them override newer direct GitHub source inspection if GitHub and the artifacts diverge.

Recent-upload caveat remains active: direct ref-qualified GitHub blob/raw file inspection is preferred over branch summary pages or cached/indirect views for recently uploaded files.

