## Validation notes

Finalization validation should include the same Worker Option C closeout gates:

```bash
find . -name '*.mjs' -print0 | sort -z | xargs -0 -n1 node --check
node ./tests/tools/checkWorkerImportCycles.mjs
node ./tests/tools/checkRuntimeFixtureCoverage.mjs
node ./tests/smokeTestWorkerProtocolContract.mjs
node ./tests/smokeTestWorkerStreamOrdering.mjs
node ./tests/smokeTestWorkerModelPathImmutability.mjs
node ./tests/smokeTestWorkerModelDisposalPolicy.mjs
SKIP_REAL_RUNTIME=1 node ./tests/smokeTestWorkerOperationSerialization.mjs
SKIP_REAL_RUNTIME=1 node ./tests/smokeTestWorkerNativeCancellationBoundary.mjs
SKIP_REAL_RUNTIME=1 node ./tests/smokeTestContextCreationCancelBoundary.mjs
SKIP_REAL_RUNTIME=1 node ./tests/smokeTestDrainShutdown.mjs
SKIP_REAL_RUNTIME=1 node ./tests/smokeTestNativeOperationHardStopPolicy.mjs
SKIP_REAL_RUNTIME=1 node ./tests/smokeTestContextCreationRetry.mjs
SKIP_REAL_RUNTIME=1 node ./tests/smokeTestInitThenResetWithoutPriorPrompt.mjs
SKIP_RUNTIME=1 node ./tests/smokeTestHardwareAwareInitRetry.mjs
```

The real-runtime dependency preflight can be locally checked in a tree without `node-llama-cpp` by running a real child mode and confirming that it fails with `[SMOKE SETUP FAILURE]` rather than a raw worker import crash.

The active-prompt target reliability path is tuned with:

```text
REAL_ACTIVE_PROMPT_CANCEL_DELAY_MS=0
REAL_ACTIVE_PROMPT_SETTLE_PROBE_MS=0
REAL_SMOKE_LONG_PROMPT_ITEMS=2000
```

If a real-runtime prompt still completes before the cancellation/shutdown action can be issued, the test reports `[SMOKE SETUP FAILURE]` and recommends increasing `REAL_SMOKE_LONG_PROMPT_ITEMS`, using a slower local model/config, or keeping `REAL_ACTIVE_PROMPT_CANCEL_DELAY_MS=0`.

If a broad combined command hits a local wrapper timeout, isolate the affected suite with a longer wrapper timeout before treating it as a behavior failure.

## Real-runtime gate

Recommended Michael-side real-runtime checks unless explicitly waived:

```bash
REAL_RUNTIME=1 node ./tests/smokeTestWorkerNativeCancellationBoundary.mjs
REAL_RUNTIME=1 node ./tests/smokeTestDrainShutdown.mjs
REAL_RUNTIME=1 node ./tests/smokeTestWorkerOperationSerialization.mjs
REAL_RUNTIME=1 node ./tests/smokeTestInitThenResetWithoutPriorPrompt.mjs
node ./tests/smokeTestLifecycleRegression.mjs
```

If these fail with `[SMOKE SETUP FAILURE]`, fix the local package-resolution layout before classifying the result as a runtime behavior failure.

`smokeTestInitThenResetWithoutPriorPrompt.mjs` default mode should fail on prompt rejection, prompt timeout, failed init/reset/shutdown, or child failure. It may warn, but should not fail by default, on empty real-model output or missing sentinel text. Use `STRICT_REAL_OUTPUT=1` or `STRICT_REAL_SENTINEL=1` only when intentionally testing output quality or model instruction compliance.

